      "contract_violation": "Phase 9/10 authority execution must consume the exact schema, proposition-licensing contract, and forbidden-inference registry sealed by the implementation-complete bundle and reviewed before owner authority decisions. A changed live contract must block before Phase 9 or Phase 10 construction or write.",
      "technical_detail": "The implementation bundle contains exact artifact identities for all three contracts, and the module already provides _bundle_artifact for enforcing those identities. However, the executor calls _bundle_artifact only for the automatic ledger, automatic coverage report, target manifest, and protected-surface preimage. It loads the forbidden registry directly and hashes the live schema and license directly into Phase 9/10 outputs without first comparing any of the three live files to their bundle rows. Consequently, drifted contract bytes are treated as the approved inputs and are laundered into new receipts and manifests.",
