      "impact": "An unreviewed schema, licensing, or inference-policy change made after the sealed implementation review and owner decisions can govern all 322 authority assertions, produce a PASS_COMPLETE 317-item coverage claim, and emit an authority-bearing candidate while the outputs falsely appear to be bound to approved contracts.",
